\ A wrong twin (plan row TB2, small tactics 1; batch-small-1-wrong.lean):
\ by-funext[ y ] on a goal that is no function equation: apply's 380.
\ LeanForth names the constant `funext` where Lean prints `@funext` (the
\ printer shows no @ before a bare constant), so check.py keeps this
\ message as LeanForth's own (OWN).
\ Lean: theorem w_funext (a : Nat) : a + 0 = a := by
\         funext y
theorem w_funext
  Nat explicit: a  a 0 + a =
:= by
  by-funext[ y ]
end w_funext
